"All 30 steps passed in the final run: `{\"PASS\":30}`, exit 0. Bends & order (step 5) is now driven entirely through the Vendor Setup UI, and the real 10839000 part ran end to end. The engine gave nothing usable on the real FULL scan, though: it returned `INVALID_INSPECTION` (mirrored part suspected) with 0 of 48 checks measured. That is logged as an informational result below, not counted against the E2E steps.\n\n**Run dir:** `/Users/idantal/ShermanQC/FullProject/docs/production/runlog/e2e/20261017T230817Z-v1/`. It contains `steps.json`, `logs/`, `pdf/`, `pdf/real/` and 63 screenshots. The whole run held the shared geometry lock, and the temp app copy and data root were deleted afterwards.\n\nAn earlier run, `.../e2e/20261017T225729Z-v1/`, is superseded. It had one FAIL: W4 required the studio's unfolded view before the flat was uploaded, and this synthetic part's CAD cannot be unfolded. The fallback that saves the draft through the API kicked in and was reported as FAIL, as intended. That run also showed 10839000's bends listed B1, B10, B11, B12, B2\u2026, which led to the API fix below.\n\n**Per-step result (final run):**\n- **Setup:** S0 PASS, S1 PASS, S2 PASS\n- **Wizard:** W1 PASS, W2 PASS, W3 PASS, W4 PASS, W5 PASS, W6 PASS, W6b PASS, W7 PASS, W8 PASS, W9 PASS\n  - W4 is the new UI-driven Bends & order step: open the studio from step 5, confirm the 4 auto-marked bends by clicking them on the model, tag the order B1, B4, B2, B3 with \u05de\u05d4\u05dc\u05da groups [B1\u00b7B4] and [B2\u00b7B3], save, return to the wizard, then check through the API.\n  - W6b is new: the studio's unfolded view now comes from the uploaded flat, toggled both ways, plus the studio in Hebrew.\n  - All 24 bend clicks in W4 and all 24 in R2 hit the on-model markers; the list-row backup was never needed.\n- **Station:** K1\u2013K11 all PASS\n- **Real 10839000:** R1 PASS, R2 PASS, R3 PASS, R4 PASS, R5 PASS\n  - R1: 12 bends auto-marked from the STEP. The STEP and FULL scan were copied read-only into the temp dir, and the copies are byte-identical to the sources.\n  - R2: all 12 confirmed, order B1\u2026B12, one \u05de\u05d4\u05dc\u05da [B1\u00b7B2].\n  - R3: released as `10839000@v1` with a REGISTERED benchmark row.\n  - R4: the FULL scan was dropped with a ZEISS-style name; the job completed in 28 s and the station showed it 0.8 s later.\n  - R5: worst-first view, Hebrew station and PDF all worked.\n- **Z1:** PASS (no page errors)\n\n**Changes:**\n- `scripts/production/run_e2e_app.mjs`:\n  - **W4:** the API path is removed. Saving through the API now runs only if the UI path breaks; the step is then recorded FAIL and only lets later steps run.\n  - **New steps and helpers:** W6b and R1\u2013R5 are new. Shared helpers handle the studio, tolerances, release and file drops.\n  - **Statuses:** the old API_ASSIST status is gone.\n- `scripts/production/run_e2e_app_support.py`:\n  - `vendor-plan`: a read-only lookup that maps each auto-marked bend to its synthetic bend so the run clicks the right order.\n  - `placeholder-drawing`: 10839000 has no authorized drawing PDF, so a page clearly labelled as a placeholder (English and Hebrew) is attached. The wizard requires one.\n  - `vendor-draft`: now only the fallback.\n- `frontend/react/src/features/part-catalog/pages/VendorSetupPage.tsx`: added data attributes only, for the test to find buttons and read state. They are `data-save-draft`, `data-order-confirmed`, `data-tag-order`, `data-apply-order`, `data-leave-without-move` and `data-confirm-bend`. Each bend row also gained `data-bend-label`, `data-review-status`, `data-mark-status` and `data-vendor-step`.\n- `apps/api/services/vendor_setup_service.py`: API fix so parts with 10 or more bends list B1, B2 \u2026 B10 instead of B1, B10, B11, B12, B2. The catalog sorts bend IDs as text; the service now sorts them naturally. This only affects the initial list, not the candidate fingerprint.\n\n**Checks:** tsc and eslint are clean, `check-onboarding-ui.mjs` passed 17/17, and `tests/test_prod_recipe_routes.py` passed (11).\n\n**Open issues (engine, for A1; I did not edit `domains/production/engine/**`):**\n1. **Real FULL scan unusable:** on 10839000 the engine returns `inspection_validity=MIRRORED_PART_SUSPECTED`, `INVALID_INSPECTION`, stage NOT_EVALUATED, and all 12 bends UNKNOWN. The station shows \"Heatmap unavailable\" and draws no scan points (the job is `line_4a006557286a4a49b78cfbbb54fd79c4`). It needs registration and mirror-check triage on real data.\n2. **No CAD unfold for these STEPs:** before a flat is uploaded, Vendor Setup can't unfold either the synthetic part or 10839000 (\"Unfolding is unavailable for this CAD geometry\"). This is recorded as informational; the plan only requires the unfolded view from the uploaded flat, which works.\n3. **Placeholder drawing:** 10839000 has no customer drawing, so the run attaches the labelled placeholder and that part's release does not represent a real drawing.\n\n**Screenshots** (all in the run dir above):\n01-production-parts.png, 02-new-part-form.png, 03-wizard-cad.png, 04-wizard-drawing.png, 05-w4-bends-entry.png, 06-w4-studio-auto-marked.png, 07-w4-studio-confirmed.png, 08-w4-studio-order-moves.png, 09-w4-studio-saved.png, 10-w4-wizard-bends-order.png, 11-wizard-flat-proposal.png, 12-wizard-flat-confirmed.png, 13-wizard-unfolded.png, 14-wizard-folded.png, 15-studio-unfolded-from-flat.png, 16-studio-folded-again.png, 17-studio-hebrew-rtl.png, 18-wizard-tolerances.png, 19-wizard-review.png, 20-wizard-released.png, 21-wizard-released-expectations.png, 22-wizard-hebrew-rtl.png, 23-station-token-gate.png, 24-station-connected.png, 25-station-in-progress.png, 26-station-result-errors.png, 27-station-heatmap-off.png, 28-station-heatmap-on.png, 29-station-cad-only.png, 30-station-scan-only.png, 31-station-cad-and-scan.png, 32-station-labels-off.png, 33-station-row2-focus.png, 34-station-worst-first.png, 35-station-before-orbit.png, 36-station-after-zoom.png, 37-station-after-touch.png, 38-station-after-orbit.png, 39-station-closeup-B1.png, 40-station-closeup-B2.png, 41-station-closeup-B3.png, 42-station-closeup-B4.png, 43-station-hebrew-rtl.png, 44-station-incomplete.png, 45-station-quarantine-issue.png, 46-station-after-assign.png, 47-station-service-killed.png, 48-station-recovered.png, 49-real-new-part-form.png, 50-real-wizard-cad.png, 51-real-bends-entry.png, 52-real-studio-auto-marked.png, 53-real-studio-confirmed.png, 54-real-studio-order-moves.png, 55-real-studio-saved.png, 56-real-wizard-bends-order.png, 57-real-tolerances.png, 58-real-review.png, 59-real-released.png, 60-real-released-expectations.png, 61-real-station-result.png, 62-real-station-worst-first.png, 63-real-station-hebrew-rtl.png\n\n**PDF page images:**\n- Synthetic part: `pdf/page-1..5.png`\n- Real part: `pdf/real/page-1..9.png`"